{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience romance that makes your heart flutter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TV Asahi and Aiming join forces to bring you a true romance simulation that could change your life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romance so real it will awaken your heart to love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/c770bf1edd67fe7f1d942f269b196872.poster.avif?t=1765359737\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/c770bf1edd67fe7f1d942f269b196872.webm?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Story&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just moved to the city, excited to begin your new college life. But after an unexpected mishap leaves you without a place to stay, you end up moving into a shared house. There, a new chapter begins as you start life under the same roof with five unique and captivating heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons change, you\u2019ll spend a year together with them, sharing moments like picking out swimsuits for summer break, joining a Halloween party, celebrating Christmas, and many more memorable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision shapes your relationships and determines the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your choices truly reach her heart and stir her emotions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your choices resonate deeply enough to touch their hearts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cHeroines\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2460 Nao</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your childhood friend who knows you better than anyone, a little jealous but always by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/6714e53eab74243db0de2924e065a8f4.poster.avif?t=1765359737\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/6714e53eab74243db0de2924e065a8f4.webm?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/6714e53eab74243db0de2924e065a8f4.mp4?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2461 Nagi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An aspiring idol trainee. She\u2019s not great at dancing but works hard every day. Though she often acts distant, she\u2019s truly a kind and caring girl inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/37b3ab171d4c53382d35b4c65af2ed98.poster.avif?t=1765359737\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/37b3ab171d4c53382d35b4c65af2ed98.webm?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/37b3ab171d4c53382d35b4c65af2ed98.mp4?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2462 Anon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reliable senior at your part-time job. With the gentle warmth of someone older, she has a way of soothing your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/3e4d91da8f531d8d3cdba3d39ebe2fe4.poster.avif?t=1765359737\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/3e4d91da8f531d8d3cdba3d39ebe2fe4.webm?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/3e4d91da8f531d8d3cdba3d39ebe2fe4.mp4?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2463 Ruka</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nationally beloved idol and the younger sister of your close friend. She\u2019s innocent, playful, and so irresistibly cute that you can\u2019t help but care for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/5e55329a4e0606c72a7a5c430f2a9d4c.poster.avif?t=1765359737\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/5e55329a4e0606c72a7a5c430f2a9d4c.webm?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/5e55329a4e0606c72a7a5c430f2a9d4c.mp4?t=1765359737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2464 Mirei</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A regular customer at your part-time job. An older woman with an air of mystery and irresistible allure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/095bf1117d07a29dda88354aaa8b1b46.poster.avif?t=1765359737\" width=1170 